<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00093/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">一个人形生物，并未认为有智能。皮肤为白色，高度约为2.38米以上，全身细长且躯干与身体比例严重失衡。当任何生物将目光注视此异常的面部或此异常的面部视频，照片时，此异常将会开始以人类声音啼哭。在1到2分钟后，其将用35千米到███千米/秒的速度冲向该个体，并且在用美式英语对该个体说“Happy April Fools' Day”之后试图回到收容所。目前看来，任何已知材料或者方法都不可能阻止其前进。</span>在2020/7/01时失去异常性质并变为无法摧毁的雕像。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/01<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██的前台，此异常被当作愚人节礼物寄往基金会。已提交关于是否可将此异常纳入普通SCP列表中的申请。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>在此异常的脚踝处写有：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>make sure ur havin' fun wis dis gift!</p>
</div>
<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">收容于Site-CN-75的人形异常收容间</span>收容于Site-CN-75的低价值异常物品储存间
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/26</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>from: SCP財団(JP)<br />
to: SCP基金会(CN)</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/27</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>SCP-096, the shy guy<br />
happy April Fools' Day!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/7/03</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>因在2020/7/01，此异常变为无法摧毁的雕像后失去了所有异常性质，对于将此异常列为正式的SCP的申请已被驳回。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00093" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00093" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00093-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/on-no" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5637670); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5637670&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609336475" alt="on-no" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5637670)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/on-no" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5637670); return false;">on-no</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587287518 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 Apr 2020 09:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00339/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张标有“口袋妖怪火红*损坏”的GBA卡带，包装和卡带封画被涂抹。当该卡带被运行时会被自动弹出，并会使插入者在48小时内看和听见的一切被用《口袋妖怪叶绿》中所含素材表示。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>天津市一家电玩店内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存在基金会低风险物品保管库内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>“说实话，还挺烦的，但重点是根本没法玩。这就是想上班玩游戏的代价吗？”———Dr.██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00339" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00339" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00339-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aslive" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3657592); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3657592&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609336475" alt="Aslive" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3657592)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aslive" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3657592); return false;">Aslive</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1596160651 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">31 Jul 2020 01:57</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00476/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">52</span>50片███牌止咳药，服用后会使服用对象的声音向异性的声线变化。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-07医务室药柜上<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-07的低价值异常物品储藏室内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我就吃了两片止咳药啊！为什么有这么多男的来对我表白啊啊啊！！！——研究员lush</em><br />
<em>可能是因为你的体型就挺像女性，还是长发，现在声音也变了&#8230;..——██博士</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00476" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00476" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00476-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lush-favor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6981514); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6981514&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609336475" alt="Lush_Favor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6981514)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lush-favor" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6981514); return false;">Lush_Favor</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1607183218 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">05 Dec 2020 15:46</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00014/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个马克杯，当其内部装有任何液体时，将无法采用除饮用外的其他任何手段使其内部的液体与该项目分离。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省██市<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-03无价值物品收容区<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>不要往这里面装一些奇奇怪怪的东西，否则谁装的就由谁来负责喝掉。</em>——站点主管██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00014" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00014" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00014-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609336475" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585806218 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Apr 2020 05:43</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00380/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>外观为一███公司生产的█型机械闹钟。此闹钟将于设定时间的前5分钟敲响。使用者将会关掉闹钟并产生“再睡5分钟”的想法并继续睡1~3小时。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/07/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr Lamp寝室内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于低风险异常物品收容柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>这个家伙让我错过了站点会议，我的全勤奖没了！——Dr Lamp</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00380" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00380" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00380-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-lamp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6508171); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6508171&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609336475" alt="Dr Lamp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6508171)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-lamp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6508171); return false;">Dr Lamp</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598615386 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Aug 2020 11:49</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00410/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">800</span>795枚材质未知且十分坚硬的硬币，在遭到弹击时将会受到超过█████████%的加速度飞射出去，这导致其被赋予了极大的动能。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██超市██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>尝试复制以供给MTF用作杀手锏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>你指尖跃动的电光，是我此生不变的信仰，唯我超电磁炮永世长存！——Dr.阙</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00410" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00410" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00410-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609336475" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601084778 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Sep 2020 01:46</span></p>
</div>
